# Per-machine and per-person, never shared. The editor writes these as you work — a
# machine-local compile database path, one desk's SDK locations, an in-flight remote
# tunnel — and committing them applies one desk's answers to everybody else's.
.vscode-local/
*.code-workspace
.DS_Store
__pycache__/

# The working agreements arrive at the workspace root as `linkfile` entries from the goal
# manifest. Nothing links into here today, and these lines keep a future one from showing
# up as an untracked file in every `repo status` forever.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
